                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Honestly for the price this is not a bad, but the flaws with the jumping mechanic, and the poor responsiveness to grabbing make this game almost unplayable. A lot of the time while jumping you with only hardly move, the large rocks allow you hands to pass into them which is fine, but you have to grab them right on the outside. You also are about 2.5 feet tall the entire time with no way to change this. All though this says it support Oculus, it swaps the grip and triggers buttons so you have to grab with the triggers.",
